EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello,

Your account is past due by {!IF (AND(Case.Originating_Lender_formula__c="Quick Bridge Funding", Case.Payment_Frequency__c="Weekly"), (Case.Payments_Behind__c/5),Case.Payments_Behind__c)} payments. Are you in the position to get any of these caught up at this time?

We can run as a lump sum or split these up if needed and run them on days of your choice. Please let me know.

Note: Please respond directly to this email and do not remove any of the contents. Any payment ran past date of maturity carries an additional $10 per day fee. **Fee will be waived if your modification was due to the hurricanes**

Thank you,

{!Case.Case_Email_Signature_Name_Formula__c}

{!Case.Originating_Lender_formula__c}
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c},
{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}
P: {!Case.OwnerPhone}



{!Case.Email_Thread_ID__c}
